        "explanation": "By the angle-bisector theorem, \\(\\frac{BD}{DC}=\\frac{AB}{AC}=\\frac{9}{6}=\\frac{3}{2}\\). Let \\(BD=3k\\) and \\(DC=2k\\). Since \\(BC=10\\), \\(5k=10\\), giving \\(BD=6\\).",
